{"speciesId":448,"names":{"fr":"Lucario","es":"Lucario","en":"Lucario","ja":"ルカリオ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has the ability to sense the auras of all things. It understands human speech."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"By catching the aura emanating from others, it can read their thoughts and movements."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It’s said that no foe can remain invisible to LUCARIO, since it can detect auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It’s said that no foe can remain invisible to LUCARIO, since it can detect auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un spécimen bien entraîné peut sentir et identifier les émotions de quelqu’un à plus d’un kilomètre."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un spécimen bien entraîné peut sentir et identifier les émotions de quelqu’un à plus d’un kilomètre."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il peut deviner les pensées et les mouvements des autres en analysant leur aura."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Puede leer los pensamientos y movimientos de su adversario a través de su aura."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"By catching the aura emanating from others, it can read their thoughts and movements."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"相手の 発する 波動を キャッチすることで 考えや 動きを 読み取ることが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut sentir et identifier les émotions de quelqu’un à plus d’un kilomètre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Emite unas ondas que le permiten percibir todo lo que se encuentre a 1 km, incluso los sentimientos de otras personas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"あらゆる ものが 出す 波動を 読みとることで １キロ先に いる 相手の 気持ちも 理解できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il peut deviner les pensées et les mouvements des autres en analysant leur aura."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Puede leer los pensamientos y movimientos de su adversario a través de su aura."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"By catching the aura emanating from others, it can read their thoughts and movements."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"相手の 発する 波動を キャッチすることで 考えや 動きを 読み取ることが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il peut sentir et identifier les émotions de quelqu’un à plus d’un kilomètre."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Emite unas ondas que le permiten percibir todo lo que se encuentre a 1 km, incluso los sentimientos de otras personas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"あらゆる ものが 出す 波動を 読みとることで １キロ先に いる 相手の 気持ちも 理解できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ne se contentant pas de percevoir les auras, il peut également les modifier. Il n’hésite pas à s’en servir en plein combat."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"No solo es capaz de detectar auras, sino también de manipularlas. Esta habilidad le resulta muy útil durante los combates."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Not only does it perceive auras, but it has also gained the power to control them. It employs them in battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"読み取るだけ ではなく 波動を 操る 力を 手に 入れた。 戦いにも 利用 するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il peut détecter les émotions des individus se trouvant à 1 km, ainsi que leur espèce. Il chasse en meute en se servant des auras."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Detecta la presencia y los sentimientos de los seres vivos a más de 1 km de distancia, habilidad que aprovecha para cazar en grupos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They can detect the species of a living being— and its emotions—from over half a mile away. They control auras and hunt their prey in packs."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"１キロ先の 生き物の 種類や 気持ちを キャッチする。 波動を 操り 群れで 獲物を 狩る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il peut canaliser son énergie mentale pour déchaîner des auras mystérieuses capables de réduire d’énormes rochers en miettes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Acumula poder espiritual y lo canaliza en forma de auras misteriosas capaces de hacer añicos incluso enormes rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It concentrates its mental energy and fires off mysterious waves called auras, which can crush boulders of large size to dust."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"精神を 集中して 放つ 波動と 呼ばれる 不思議な 波は 大岩をも 粉々に 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Grâce à ses auras, il peut détecter toutes les émotions de son adversaire, même celles qu’il préférerait ignorer et qui lui causent du stress."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Puede percibir sentimientos ajenos a través de su aura, pero averiguar cosas que preferiría no saber constituye una fuente de estrés para él."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Lucario reads its opponent’s feelings with its aura waves. It finds out things it would rather not know, so it gets stressed out easily."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"波動の 波で 相手の 気持ちを キャッチする。 知りたくないことも わかるので ストレスを ためやすい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il chasse ses proies en se servant d’une force appelée aura, dont la puissance est telle qu’elle lui permet de réduire un rocher en poussière."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Caza a sus presas manipulando una energía, denominada aura, cuya potencia es capaz incluso de hacer añicos rocas enormes."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It controls waves known as auras, which are powerful enough to pulverize huge rocks. It uses these waves to take down its prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"大岩も 粉々に 砕く 波動と 呼ばれる 力を 操って 獲物を 狩る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Étant capable de lire ce que pensent les humains, ce Pokémon ne s’attache qu’aux Dresseurs dotés d’un cœur pur."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Puede leer los pensamientos de la gente, por lo que establece lazos afectivos únicamente con Entrenadores de corazón noble."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It can tell what people are thinking. Only Trainers who have justice in their hearts can earn this Pokémon’s trust."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"人の 考えていることも わかるので 正しい 心の トレーナーにしか 懐かない。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"A most gallant-looking creature. It emits energy waves and controls them with precision, using them to sense even faraway beings. I have given the name ”aura” to this power."}],"varieties":[{"id":448,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[